@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@staffToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY_DO_NOT_COMMIT_TOKEN
@studentToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY_DO_NOT_COMMIT_TOKEN
@studentId = 1
@scholarshipId = 1
@batchId = REPLACE_WITH_BATCH_UUID
@commitDigest = REPLACE_WITH_PREVIEW_DIGEST
@submissionId = REPLACE_WITH_SUBMISSION_UUID

### Login NISN (isi password hanya lokal, jangan commit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"nisn":"0012345678","password":"REPLACE_LOCALLY"}

### Akun dan hak aktual dari server
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Profil milik pemilik token
GET {{baseUrl}}/profil-siswa/saya
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Usulan profil, belum langsung menjadi master
POST {{baseUrl}}/profil-siswa/saya/submission
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"nama_panggilan":"Contoh"}

### Review profil
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/profile-submissions/{{submissionId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"status":"approved"}

### Template impor nilai (modul lain: students,assessments,alumni,financial,aid,economy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/templates/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Preview impor: buat multipart di FE/Postman memakai file dan field dari b4-impor.md
### Jangan isi file mentah atau data sekolah ke berkas HTTP ini.

### Commit hanya setelah meninjau preview
POST {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{batchId}}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"commit_digest":"{{commitDigest}}"}

### Status batch milik sendiri
GET {{baseUrl}}/imports/{{batchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### UKT di bawah Rp2 juta
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/ukt-ipk?ukt_lt=2000000
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Buku PDF agregat (download blob di FE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/buku-alumni/pdf?tahun_lulus=2024
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/pdf

### Pratinjau ranking ML, tidak memanggil Gemini dan tidak membuat draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/siswa/{{studentId}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa/preview?target_jenjang=Kuliah
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Chat milik siswa sendiri
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat-beasiswa
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"message":"Apakah saya memenuhi syarat program ini?","beasiswa_id":{{scholarshipId}},"target_jenjang":"Kuliah"}

### Chat staff untuk profil yang dikelola
POST {{baseUrl}}/siswa/{{studentId}}/chat-beasiswa
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"message":"Apa data yang perlu dilengkapi untuk program ini?","beasiswa_id":{{scholarshipId}},"target_jenjang":"Kuliah"}
